# UPSTREAM-DELTA.patch -- tauri 2.11.2
#
# Unified diff: pristine crates.io source (static.crates.io tarball,
# tauri-2.11.2.crate) -> vendored source at patches/tauri-2.11.2/.
# This is the ground-truth record of what Maekon changed relative to
# upstream. See ../README.md for the refresh procedure and the why/what
# summary per crate.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   curl -L https://static.crates.io/crates/tauri/tauri-2.11.2.crate -o /tmp/tauri-2.11.2.crate
#   mkdir -p /tmp/pristine && tar xzf /tmp/tauri-2.11.2.crate -C /tmp/pristine
#   diff -ruN --exclude=target --exclude=.cargo_vcs_info.json \
#     --exclude=.cargo-ok --exclude=Cargo.toml.orig --exclude=Cargo.lock \
#     /tmp/pristine/tauri-2.11.2 patches/tauri-2.11.2 > patches/tauri-2.11.2/UPSTREAM-DELTA.patch
#
# Excluded as crates.io tarball / repo-local packaging noise (see README
# 'Exclusions' section): .cargo_vcs_info.json, .cargo-ok, Cargo.toml.orig,
# Cargo.lock (per-patch-crate lockfiles were removed as non-shipping
# Dependabot noise, PR #5862 / commit 1a4a0a85f0), target/.
#
